  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Intro by Disco Stu**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n- **The World Is A Ghetto**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 14 archived performances [2]\n- **Cissy Strut**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 6 archived performances [2]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Jesus Children Of America, Azucar [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **soulive1999-09-15.schoeps.ccm4** (recommended): source not stated; 11 songs; 107 min [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **soulive1999-09-15.schoeps.ccm4**: taped by Paul deLima; transferred by Paul deLima; source: (stage lip) Schoeps CCM4 (ORTF) > Grace Design Lunatec V2 > Tascam DA-P1 @16bit 44.1kHz [1]. Also: DAT was transferred by s/pdif to PC, burned to CD-R, extracted with EAC, then edited in Sound Forge, including clipped peak restoration, and converted to FLAC; Paul deLima recorded, transferred and uploaded the show to the Live Music Archive [1]",
